      "remarks": "Project-authored OSCAL encoding of a selected HIPAA Security Rule subset, not an official or complete HIPAA OSCAL catalog. Regulatory statements were transcribed from 45 CFR 164.308 and 164.312 as displayed by eCFR on 2026-10-23 (title content shown current through 2026-10-21). The contingency-plan entry includes all five implementation specifications under the selected paragraph. Other entries contain the text of their exact cited paragraph. SP 800-66 Rev. 2 is implementation guidance. Project implementation claims and secondary framework mappings remain in the component definition."
    },
